# Jotan

## Lore

The Jotan, the Earth Giants, are the largest and most powerful giants of the Palladium World - bitter, cruel, and quick to lash out at any non-giant they meet. They are master metal workers, second only to the Dwarves, and forge weapons and armor for the other giant races, the Cyclops and Nimro above all.

Only a handful are known on Rifts Earth, where they took at once to Mega-Damage armor and alloys. A secret Jotan works in or near the New German Republic makes giant-sized Mega-Damage armor and weapons for fellow giants and Gargoyles; the NGR would destroy it if it could find it.

**Alignment:** Any, but leans toward Anarchist and evil.

**Appearance:** Bronze-skinned giants with powerful builds, dark eyes and brown hair.

**Height:** 18 to 20 feet (5.4 to 6.1 m). **Weight:** 800 to 2,000 pounds (360 to 900 kg).

**Average Life Span:** 300 years.

## GM Notes

Jotan are not the smartest giants and prefer a life of labor - fighters, miners, smelters, smiths, builders and armorers. They keep to themselves, are aggressive and vengeful toward humans and other small folk, and have been known to command troops of Orcs, Goblins and other monster races. Traditional enemies are Titans, Elves, Dwarves and humans; allies are Cyclops, Nimro, Trolls, Ogres, Orcs and Goblins. On Rifts Earth they are taken for monsters or D-Bees.
', 'published', 'data-script'
